{"title": "Alchemist's Fire", "pageid": 3716, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Alchemist's_Fire", "categories": ["Bugs", "Grenades", "Common items", "Sources of Fire damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/9/93/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Alchemist's Fire image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/GRN_Alchemist%27s_Fire_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Alchemist's Fire</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenade</a>) item which can be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a> to create a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Shapes swirl and glow behind the glass, liquid embers folding into and around each other.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/25px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/38px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/50px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grenades\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/25px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenades</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.3 kg (0.6 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.3 kg (0.6 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 13 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  13  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f8dc27f8e6dfe7e3END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f751d00bb1312704END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-29dd0cc5a0d6e2a8END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GRN_FireFlask_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GRN_FireFlask_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GRN_FireFlask_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0b1aa718-fe45-4e4c-8811-ced51c581075</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0b1aa718-fe45-4e4c-8811-ced51c581075\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0b1aa718-fe45-4e4c-8811-ced51c581075\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_FireBottle</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_FireBottle+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_FireBottle+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Hurl a flask of liquid fire that explodes on impact\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Aoe Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>Creates area: Fire</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Fire\"> Area: Fire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/45px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/60px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 3 m (10 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 3 m (10 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Burning\"> Condition: Burning </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li>Can be removed with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action, using a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Healing Potion</a> or gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li>Immune from if <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/25px-Dip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/38px-Dip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/50px-Dip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/25px-Dip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\">Dip</a> action can be used on Burning characters or objects.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by various <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">merchants</a> throughout the game, including:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/38px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/50px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brem\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\">Brem</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Hideout\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zhentarim Hideout\">Zhentarim Hideout</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/38px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/50px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cyrel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\">Cyrel</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road#Toll_House\" title=\"The Risen Road\">Risen Road Toll House</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/38px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/50px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roah Moonglow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashes_of_Fire_Amber\" title=\"Ashes of Fire Amber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Extract_Ashes_Orange_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ashes_of_Fire_Amber\" title=\"Ashes of Fire Amber\">Ashes of Fire Amber</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Amber\" title=\"Fire Amber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Fire_Amber_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Amber\" title=\"Fire Amber\">Fire Amber</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Salt</a></li>\n<li>Carried by several enemies and found in various locations throughout the game</li></ul>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The shorter 1 turn duration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> effect applied by a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface overwrites the longer 3 turn duration from the Alchemist's Fire itself. As a result, in most cases burning inflicted by Alchemist's Fire only lasts 1 turn.\n<ul><li>If the fire surface cannot be created for some reason (e.g. there is already a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\">Blood</a> pool around the target), then the full 3 turn duration effect can be applied.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Alchemist's Fire has 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></td><td>Vulnerable</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></td><td>Vulnerable</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a></td><td>Immune</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a></td><td>Immune</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200840\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.149 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.158 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7239/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 90242/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21247/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1597950/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.074      1 -total\n 87.33%  110.104      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n 47.43%   59.793     26 Template:Icon_text\n 43.23%   54.496     92 Template:Trim\n 31.57%   39.797     19 Template:Icon_link\n 19.34%   24.384      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.31%   24.342      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.03%   20.215      1 Template:Area_full\n 15.11%   19.047     30 Template:Ifempty\n 12.44%   15.684      1 Template:Area_full/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3716-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200840 and revision id 386747. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}